      "id": 39261,
      "name": "lugaru",
      "username": "lugaru",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/lugaru/{size}/2767_2.png",
      "created_at": "2012-09-28T13:50:07.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>There where some blog or forum posts where they showed him putting energy and light and stuff around a bunch of objects on the original pics, touching 'em up.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Also the printers layed that paint on THICK... a bunch of my cards almost feel textured. They really pop visually...</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>... which is insane for an indy company with just one artist. I recently got into the Vampire CCG and you see some cards where the art is just sad. A lot of it is up to white wolf standards, some are a pic of a dude with a photoshop filter.</p>",
      "post_number": 4,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T02:12:59.856Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
