      "created_at": "2012-09-28T14:08:00.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I notcied a lot of the cards that involve lights, flashes, anything that's supposed to shine are very very bright. Liek the sheep from oblivion. Maybe I was just used to the muted colors and my eyes havn't gotten used to it. It is very pretty. I'm so eager to play the enw games tonight!</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Bravo Adam</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
